<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es-MX">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>MoySoporteTec | Soporte técnico, reparación de computadoras, redes y cámaras</title>
<meta name="description" content="Soporte técnico a domicilio y remoto: reparación de computadoras y laptops, instalación de SSD y RAM, redes Wi-Fi, cámaras de seguridad y venta de equipo. Diagnóstico sin costo.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0B1016">
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://moysoportetec.com/">

<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:locale" content="es_MX">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="MoySoporteTec">
<meta property="og:title" content="MoySoporteTec | Soporte técnico y reparación de equipos">
<meta property="og:description" content="Reparación de computadoras, redes Wi-Fi, cámaras de seguridad y venta de tecnología. Atención en sitio y remota.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://moysoportetec.com/">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">

<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="data:image/png;base64,">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;600;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root{
  --ink:#0B1016;
  --ink-2:#0F161F;
  --panel:#141D28;
  --line:#22303F;
  --line-soft:rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  --text:#E9EFF5;
  --muted:#93A4B5;
  --blue:#2E9BFF;
  --blue-deep:#0B63C6;
  --amber:#FFB020;
  --ok:#3DD68C;
  --radius:14px;
  --maxw:1140px;
  --font-display:"Archivo","Helvetica Neue",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  --font-text:"Inter","Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:88px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{
  background:var(--ink);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:var(--font-text);
  font-size:16px;
  line-height:1.65;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
img,svg{max-width:100%}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--amber);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}

h1,h2,h3,.logo,.stat-num,.price{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3.4vw,2.3rem)}
h3{font-size:1.06rem;letter-spacing:-.01em}
p{text-wrap:pretty}

.wrap{width:min(var(--maxw),90%);margin-inline:auto}
.skip{position:absolute;left:-9999px;top:0;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;z-index:200;border-radius:0 0 10px 0;font-weight:600}
.skip:focus{left:0}

/* ---------- Header ---------- */
.site-header{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:100;transition:background .25s ease,border-color .25s ease}
.site-header::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(11,16,22,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid transparent;opacity:0;transition:opacity .25s ease;z-index:-1}
.site-header.stuck::after{opacity:1;border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
.nav{height:78px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:1.22rem;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.logo img{flex:none;width:38px;height:auto;display:block}
.logo b{font-weight:800}
.logo i{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px}
.nav-links a{font-size:.94rem;font-weight:500;color:#C6D3E0;position:relative;padding:4px 0}
.nav-links a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:100%;bottom:0;height:2px;background:var(--blue);transition:right .22s ease}
.nav-links a:hover::after,.nav-links a[aria-current="true"]::after{right:0}
.nav-links a[aria-current="true"]{color:#fff}
.nav-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--blue);color:#04121F;font-weight:600;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-size:.92rem;transition:transform .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease}
.nav-cta:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(46,155,255,.28)}
.burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);cursor:pointer;color:var(--text);align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.burger span{display:block;width:18px;height:2px;background:currentColor;position:relative;transition:transform .2s ease,background .2s ease}
.burger span::before,.burger span::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;width:18px;height:2px;background:currentColor;transition:transform .2s ease}
.burger span::before{top:-6px}.burger span::after{top:6px}
.burger[aria-expanded="true"] span{background:transparent}
.burger[aria-expanded="true"] span::before{transform:translateY(6px) rotate(45deg)}
.burger[aria-expanded="true"] span::after{transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg)}

/* ---------- Hero ---------- */
.hero{position:relative;padding:146px 0 84px}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-120px;right:-160px;width:620px;height:620px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(46,155,255,.20),transparent 62%);filter:blur(30px);pointer-events:none}
.hero-grid{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:52px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:.84rem;font-weight:600;color:#9DC9F2;background:rgba(46,155,255,.09);border:1px solid rgba(46,155,255,.26);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:20px}
.dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(61,214,140,.16)}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.4vw,3.9rem);margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.035em}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}
.lead{font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:28px}
.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-bottom:26px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:600;font-size:.97rem;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-text);transition:transform .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease,background .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--blue),var(--blue-deep));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(11,99,198,.3)}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(11,99,198,.42)}
.btn-ghost{border-color:var(--line);color:var(--text);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:#33465c}
.btn-wa{background:#25D366;color:#06210F}
.btn-wa:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(37,211,102,.3)}
.trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 22px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)}
.trust span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.trust svg{color:var(--ok);flex:none}

/* Diagnóstico rápido (pieza central) */
.quote{background:linear-gradient(170deg,var(--panel),#0D141D);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}
.quote h2{font-size:1.16rem;margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.quote .hint{font-size:.87rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}
.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);color:#C9D6E3;font-size:.87rem;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:border-color .18s ease,background .18s ease,color .18s ease}
.chip:hover{border-color:#3a5271}
.chip[aria-pressed="true"]{background:rgba(46,155,255,.14);border-color:var(--blue);color:#EAF4FF}
.chip .tick{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;border:1.5px solid #46607e;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}
.chip[aria-pressed="true"] .tick{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue)}
.chip .tick svg{opacity:0;color:#04121F}
.chip[aria-pressed="true"] .tick svg{opacity:1}
.quote-foot{border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding-top:16px;display:grid;gap:12px}
.quote-sum{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);min-height:1.4em}
.quote-sum b{color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:18px}
.stat{background:var(--ink-2);padding:14px 12px;text-align:center}
.stat-num{display:block;font-size:1.3rem;color:#fff}
.stat small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.35;display:block}

/* ---------- Secciones ---------- */
section{padding:86px 0}
.band{background:var(--ink-2);border-block:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
.head{max-width:62ch;margin-bottom:38px}
.head.center{margin-inline:auto;text-align:center}
.head h2{margin-bottom:10px}
.head p{color:var(--muted)}

.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease}
.card:hover{border-color:#34506e;transform:translateY(-3px)}
.card .ico{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(46,155,255,.1);color:var(--blue);border:1px solid rgba(46,155,255,.2);margin-bottom:16px}
.card h3{margin-bottom:7px}
.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem}
.card ul{list-style:none;margin-top:13px;display:grid;gap:6px}
.card li{font-size:.85rem;color:#8FA2B4;padding-left:16px;position:relative}
.card li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.62em;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--line);}

/* Proceso (sí es una secuencia, por eso va numerado) */
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}
.step{padding:26px 22px;background:var(--panel);border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.step:last-child{border-right:0}
.step-n{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:10px}
.step h3{margin-bottom:6px;font-size:1rem}
.step p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}

/* Productos */
.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.product{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease}
.product:hover{border-color:#34506e;transform:translateY(-3px)}
.product-top{height:130px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:
  radial-gradient(circle at 50% 120%,rgba(46,155,255,.22),transparent 60%),
  repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.028) 0 2px,transparent 2px 9px),
  linear-gradient(160deg,#16222F,#0C131B);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--blue)}
.product-body{padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}
.tag{align-self:flex-start;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(255,176,32,.12);color:var(--amber);border:1px solid rgba(255,176,32,.25);margin-bottom:11px}
.product h3{margin-bottom:6px}
.product p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem;flex:1}
.price{color:var(--amber);font-size:1.02rem;margin:14px 0 14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0}
.price small{display:block;font-family:var(--font-text);font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:0}
.product .btn{width:100%;padding:12px 16px;font-size:.92rem}

/* Por qué */
.why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:46px;align-items:center}
.checks{display:grid;gap:2px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}
.check{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:20px 22px;background:var(--panel)}
.check svg{flex:none;color:var(--ok);margin-top:3px}
.check strong{display:block;font-size:.98rem;margin-bottom:2px}
.check span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}

/* FAQ */
.faq{display:grid;gap:10px;max-width:820px;margin-inline:auto}
details{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
details[open]{border-color:#34506e}
summary{cursor:pointer;padding:17px 20px;font-weight:600;font-size:.98rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;list-style:none}
summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
summary::after{content:"";width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid var(--blue);border-bottom:2px solid var(--blue);transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .2s ease;flex:none;margin-top:-4px}
details[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);margin-top:2px}
details p{padding:0 20px 18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem;max-width:70ch}

/* Contacto */
.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:22px}
.info{display:grid;gap:12px;align-content:start}
.info-item{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--panel)}
.info-item svg{flex:none;color:var(--blue);margin-top:3px}
.info-item strong{display:block;font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:2px}
.info-item span,.info-item a{color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}
.info-item a:hover{color:var(--blue)}
.form-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:26px}
.field{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-bottom:14px}
.field label{font-size:.86rem;font-weight:500;color:#C6D3E0}
.field input,.field textarea,.field select{
  width:100%;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);
  background:#0C131C;color:var(--text);font:inherit;font-size:.95rem;transition:border-color .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease
}
.field textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
.field input::placeholder,.field textarea::placeholder{color:#5F7286}
.field input:focus,.field textarea:focus,.field select:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(46,155,255,.16);outline:none}
.field .err{font-size:.8rem;color:#FF8A8A;min-height:0}
.field.invalid input,.field.invalid textarea{border-color:#FF6B6B}
.form-card .btn{width:100%;margin-top:4px}
.form-note{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;text-align:center}
.status{margin-top:12px;font-size:.9rem;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;display:none}
.status.show{display:block}
.status.ok{background:rgba(61,214,140,.1);border:1px solid rgba(61,214,140,.3);color:#A8EFCB}
.status.warn{background:rgba(255,176,32,.09);border:1px solid rgba(255,176,32,.28);color:#FFD68A}

/* Footer + WA */
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:38px 0 34px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
.foot-brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.foot-brand img{width:210px;height:auto}
.foot-right{display:grid;gap:16px;justify-items:end}
.socials{display:flex;gap:10px}
.socials a{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#AFC0D1;transition:color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease,transform .18s ease}
.socials a:hover{color:var(--blue);border-color:#34506e;transform:translateY(-2px)}
.socials.inline a{width:38px;height:38px}
@media (max-width:620px){.foot-right{justify-items:start}.foot-brand img{width:180px}}
.foot{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.foot-links{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.foot-links a:hover{color:var(--blue)}
.wa-float{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;z-index:95;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#25D366;color:#06210F;font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:999px;box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(37,211,102,.34);transition:transform .2s ease}
.wa-float:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.wa-float .lbl{display:inline}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width:980px){
  .hero-grid,.why-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero{padding-top:128px}
  .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .step:nth-child(2){border-right:0}
  .step:nth-child(-n+2){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .cards,.products{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
@media (max-width:820px){
  .nav-links{
    position:absolute;top:78px;left:0;right:0;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:0;
    background:#0C131C;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 5% 18px;
    max-height:0;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden;transition:max-height .28s ease,visibility .28s
  }
  .nav-links.open{max-height:420px;visibility:visible}
  .nav-links a{padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);font-size:1rem}
  .nav-links a::after{display:none}
  .nav-links .nav-cta{margin-top:14px;justify-content:center;border-bottom:0}
  .burger{display:inline-flex}
}
@media (max-width:620px){
  section{padding:62px 0}
  .cards,.products,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .step{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .step:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .quote{padding:20px}
  .wa-float .lbl{display:none}
  .wa-float{padding:16px;border-radius:50%}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
  *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<a class="skip" href="#main">Saltar al contenido</a>

<header class="site-header" id="header">
  <nav class="wrap nav" aria-label="Navegación principal">
    <a class="logo" href="#inicio" aria-label="MoySoporteTec, inicio">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," width="38" height="39" alt="" decoding="async">
      <span><b>Moy</b><i>SoporteTec</i></span>
    </a>

    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navLinks" aria-label="Abrir menú"><span></span></button>

    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#servicios">Servicios</a>
      <a href="#proceso">Cómo trabajamos</a>
      <a href="#productos">Productos</a>
      <a href="#faq">Preguntas</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" id="navWa" href="#contacto">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 004.79 1.22h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.82 9.82 0 0012.04 2zm0 18.15h-.01a8.2 8.2 0 01-4.19-1.15l-.3-.18-3.12.82.83-3.04-.2-.31a8.18 8.18 0 01-1.26-4.38c0-4.54 3.7-8.24 8.25-8.24a8.2 8.2 0 018.24 8.25c0 4.54-3.7 8.23-8.24 8.23zm4.52-6.16c-.25-.12-1.47-.72-1.69-.81-.23-.08-.39-.12-.56.13-.16.24-.64.8-.79.97-.14.16-.29.18-.54.06-.25-.13-1.05-.39-1.99-1.23-.74-.66-1.23-1.47-1.38-1.72-.14-.25-.01-.38.11-.5.11-.11.25-.29.37-.43.13-.15.17-.25.25-.41.08-.17.04-.31-.02-.43-.06-.12-.56-1.34-.76-1.84-.2-.48-.41-.42-.56-.42l-.48-.01c-.17 0-.43.06-.66.31-.22.25-.87.85-.87 2.07s.89 2.4 1.02 2.56c.12.17 1.75 2.67 4.23 3.74.59.26 1.05.41 1.41.52.59.19 1.13.16 1.56.1.47-.07 1.47-.6 1.67-1.18.21-.58.21-1.07.15-1.18-.06-.11-.22-.17-.47-.29z"/></svg>
        WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<main id="main">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero" id="inicio">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Atendemos hoy mismo · en sitio y remoto</p>
        <h1>Tu computadora deja de ser un problema <em>desde el primer diagnóstico.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Reparamos equipos lentos o descompuestos, instalamos redes Wi-Fi y cámaras de seguridad, y vendemos el equipo que tu casa o tu negocio necesita. Revisamos primero, cotizamos después.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contacto">Pedir diagnóstico</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#servicios">Ver servicios</a>
        </div>
        <p class="trust">
          <span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Diagnóstico sin costo</span>
